Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.59,Cap,,0,0,0,,Small US nonprofits file Form 990-EZ every year.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.59,0:00:05.60,Cap,,0,0,0,,Most have no finance staff.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.60,0:00:10.69,Cap,,0,0,0,,Miss three years running and the\NIRS revokes your tax exempt status.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.69,0:00:13.60,Cap,,0,0,0,,That list holds over a million entries.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.60,0:00:17.41,Cap,,0,0,0,,Filing tools start after the books are categorised.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.41,0:00:21.00,Cap,,0,0,0,,Categorising them is the work nobody helps with.
